      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't want this, it's immersion breaking, and it would also let people sneak in NSFW in public.\nif I want to be able to \"see everything correctly\" in VRChat, that should be my choice. I can disable the safety system and all rendering limits and do it. I shouldn't need to be everyone's friend to see everything that's actually going on in an instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
