  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-20T07:51:07.824Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A safety setting that makes it so that if a person is not your friend, they can only view your fallback avatar. This would give people who are self conscious about how they identify a way to make it so that only people they are comfortable around are the only ones who can see that side of them. This could be applied to so many groups of the VRC community and make them feel so much safer and comfortable playing the game.",
